. What issues can you notice?

Even though Provider solves the shared-state problem, as the application becomes larger, you can notice some difficulties:-

-> Many widgets may depend on the same CartProvider.
-> It can become difficult to know which widget is changing the state.
-> If many Consumers are used, debugging rebuilds can become tricky.
-> Business logic can become large inside one ChangeNotifier.
-> Different screens may trigger the same methods from different places.
-> If the provider contains too much logic, the class can become difficult to maintain.
-> Incorrect use of notifyListeners() can cause unnecessary UI rebuilds.
